{"chars": "Sitting on the mossy spruce log was the tiniest person they had ever seen. She was exactly as tall as the Fairy Slipper itself. Her skin was smooth and pale like birch bark, with little dark markings here and there, just like a birch tree. Her hair was soft and gray-green and curly, made of lichen. On her back were two thin wings that shimmered green and gold, like a dragonfly's, and when she moved them, they made a tiny sound, frrrrr. Her eyes were the warm brown of forest soil, and her voice was as soft as a dewdrop landing on a leaf.", "start": [0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.537, 0.537, 0.537, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.637, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.075, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.775, 1.775, 1.775, 1.775, 1.95, 1.95, 1.95, 1.95, 2.087, 2.087, 2.087, 2.087, 2.087, 2.087, 2.087, 2.087, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 3.025, 3.025, 3.025, 3.025, 3.025, 3.138, 3.138, 3.138, 3.138, 3.25, 3.25, 3.25, 3.25, 3.25, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 3.513, 4.225, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.562, 4.562, 4.562, 4.562, 4.562, 4.562, 4.562, 4.562, 5.088, 5.088, 5.088, 5.237, 5.237, 5.237, 5.237, 5.237, 5.513, 5.513, 5.513, 5.65, 5.65, 5.65, 5.65, 5.787, 5.787, 5.787, 5.787, 5.787, 5.787, 6.213, 6.213, 6.213, 6.213, 6.213, 6.213, 6.213, 6.213, 6.525, 6.525, 6.525, 6.525, 6.525, 6.525, 6.525, 7.475, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.213, 8.213, 8.213, 8.213, 8.213, 8.213, 8.213, 8.625, 8.625, 8.625, 8.625, 8.762, 8.762, 8.762, 8.762, 8.762, 9.125, 9.125, 9.125, 9.125, 9.125, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.7, 9.7, 9.7, 9.7, 9.7, 10.3, 10.4, 10.4, 10.4, 10.4, 10.4, 10.537, 10.537, 10.537, 10.537, 10.537, 10.537, 10.537, 10.775, 10.775, 10.775, 10.775, 10.775, 11.1, 11.1, 11.1, 11.1, 11.1, 11.1, 11.1, 11.1, 11.1, 11.575, 11.575, 11.575, 11.575, 11.575, 11.787, 11.787, 11.787, 11.787, 11.887, 1